DSH-Android patch 17: llm-service-lite (vendored @snnh/dsh-llm-service-lite 0.2.1), chat-completions
thinking echo-back and gateway compatibility. Applies on top of patches 14 and 16.

Thinking echo-back. The chat wire read thinking only from `delta.reasoning_content` and sent it back
only as `reasoning_content`, only when the model id matched a catalog family declaring replay. Now:
 - thinking is read from `reasoning_content`, `reasoning`, `reasoning_details` (merged by index,
   signatures / encrypted items kept) and thinking parts of an array `content`; per-call
   `extra_content` (Gemini thought signatures) is kept too;
 - the finish chunk records, as adapter-private replay state on the assistant message
   (`source.replayState.response`, kind `llm-service-lite-chat` v1, no per-block entries), which
   fields / shape the thinking arrived in and the endpoint (base URL origin + path) it came from;
 - the request path writes it back in that same field / shape, only to the same provider route and
   base URL: always on assistant turns with tool calls, on other turns only when the model's family
   or capabilities declare replay; never with `replayReasoning: false`; `reasoning_details` and
   `extra_content` only to the same model. History without a record keeps the upstream rule.
 - an HTTP 400 naming an echoed field is retried once without echo; the base URL is remembered.

Gateway compatibility (found by js/test/gateway-replay.test.mjs):
 - a JSON (non-streaming) completion body is translated instead of reading as a cut-off stream;
 - any finish_reason ends the turn (`tool_use`, `max_tokens`, `sensitive`, `eos`...); `stop` with
   tool calls is `tool-calls`; `error` / `network_error` is a SERVER failure;
 - tool calls: matched by id, then index; index-less calls (Gemini), index 0 reused for parallel
   calls, names repeated per frame, ids that never arrive (synthesized), "" arguments ("{}");
 - usage inside the final choice (Moonshot); cache hits as `prompt_cache_hit_tokens` (DeepSeek) or
   `cached_tokens` (Moonshot);
 - CJK exhausted-balance wording (欠费 / 余额不足 / AccountOverdue) is QUOTA, not RATE_LIMIT.

